<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Even as the crowds spilled into the neighbourhood, not a single Elvi dared cross the mansion\'92s threshold. The Sanctity of the Holy Momma and the Word of the Cleaner were absolute.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah felt her inhibitions slither away as the patch worked its magic. Before she\'92d considered, she grabbed her tablet and hailed. Alexander\'92s puke-worthy mug flickered onto the screen\'97round and fuzzy at the edges, with beady, too-bright eyes, a snub little nose, and ears that seemed to be sprouting their own sideburns. There was something about that face: uncanny, almost koala-cute, but just off enough to make Sarah want to disinfect her screen.\
